    },
    {
      "id": "remielle-mindscape_4-the_long_goodbye",
      "source": "mindscape",
      "sourceId": "remielle-mindscape_4",
      "label": "The Long Goodbye (Mindscape Cinema N°4)",
      "description": "When Remielle triggers Luminize, the DMG multiplier is increased by an additional 12%. After entering the battlefield and gaining 3 special Voidflares, if all Voidflares are consumed, she immediately gains the maximum number of special Voidflares again. This effect to regain special Voidflares is removed after being triggered once or when Remielle enters the Phase Flow state.",
