        "name": "Flower & Feather Dance (Assist)",
        "description": "Enters the battlefield and unleashes an attack in a large area, dealing Lumiflux DMG.\n\nConsumes 40 /bFloating Radiance//b pon activation. With 90 or fewer /bFloating Radiance//b remaining upon activation, this /bAssist: Flower & Feather Dance//b does not consume /bFloating Radiance//b. Remielle also enters the /bLuminous Reflection//b state, and the next /bBasic Attack: Rainbow's End//b is upgraded to /bBasic Attack: Fleeting Grace//b.\n\nWhen this skill hits a Stunned enemy, their Stun duration is extended by 3s. Each enemy can be affected by this effect only once per Stun window. This Stun duration increase cannot stack with other effects of the same type. If this skill lands a hit, the Luminize effect can be triggered after the skill ends with a set multiplier. Character is invulnerable while using this skill.",
