      {
        "id": "remielle_dan-special-ode_to_dawn_radiant_turn",
        "name": "Ode to Dawn - Radiant Turn (Special Attack)",
        "description": "When Remielle is in combat and her /bFloating Radiance//b reaches its maximum of 120, hold [SPECIAL] after a /bSpecial Attack//b or /bEX Special Attack//b to enter /bStance Shift//b. Switching characters while in /bStance Shift//b causes Remielle to enter the /bPhase Flow//b state:\n\nWhile in the /bPhase Flow//b state, Remielle acts autonomously to assist in combat. In this state, /bFloating Radiance//b is consumed over time, and some of her attacks apply Lumiflux Buildup to the target. When /bFloating Radiance//b is fully depleted or upon leaving combat, Remielle exits the /bPhase Flow//b state. Before exiting the /bPhase Flow//b state, Remielle cannot be actively switched in except via a /bChain Attack//b.\n\nIf Remielle triggers 3 Refringe reactions in one /bPhase Flow//b state, or has at least 1 stored /bVoidflare//b when /bFloating Radiance//b is fully depleted, /bAssist: Flower & Feather Dance//b becomes available, and her normal switch-in is unlocked. /bAssist: Flower & Feather Dance//b is automatically used on Remielle's next normal switch-in. Upon entering the /bPhase Flow//b state, Remielle increases all squad members's DMG by a percentage for 60s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.\n\nWhen Remielle's /bFloating Radiance//b has reached its maximum of 120 and her /bSpecial Attack//b or /bEX Special Attack//b hits a Stunned enemy, she can also enter the /bPhase Flow//b state by switching characters during the /bSpecial Attack//b or /bEX Special Attack//b. If no character is switched in after entering /bStance Shift//b, Remielle uses a downward attack to return to the ground instead.",
